# RAG sidecar (Qdrant mirror) — no repo artifacts by design:
# index lives in the Qdrant Docker named volume (qdrant_storage), embeddings
# come from LM Studio over HTTP. tools/*.py write nothing to the repo
# (resumability is via the Qdrant skip-test, not a state file), so there is
# nothing to ignore beyond the Python cache entries above. Do NOT add the
# collection data here; it never touches disk in this repo.

# LSP (opencode "lsp": true) — servers install under ~/.cache / project
# .opencode/node_modules (already ignored via .opencode/.gitignore).
